1
00:00:00,376 --> 00:00:03,926
l can't help it,
l feel like a teen heartthrob.

2
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:08,590
(Penny:)Sheldon, I used to cut my brother's hair.
l could do it.

3
00:00:08,801 --> 00:00:14,431
(Sheldon:)Penny, I know you mean well,
offering the skills of the hill folk...

4
00:00:15,433 --> 00:00:18,023
...but here in town,
we don't churn our own butter...

5
00:00:18,228 --> 00:00:20,358
...we don't make dresses
out of gunny sacks...

6
00:00:20,563 --> 00:00:23,813
...and we sure as shooting
don't get our hair cut by bottle-blond...

7
00:00:24,025 --> 00:00:25,735
(Leonard:)Sheldon, be nice.

8
00:00:26,778 --> 00:00:30,658
I'm sorry, it's the bad-boy attitude
that comes with this hair.

9
00:00:33,576 --> 00:00:36,366
(Raj:)You could go to my guy.
He's at Juan-Juan in Beverly Hills.

10
00:00:36,579 --> 00:00:38,829
(Raj:)They bring you a cup of tea,
massage your scalp.

11
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:41,500
It's $200 but sometimes
you look in the next chair...

12
00:00:41,709 --> 00:00:44,709
(Raj:)...and you see a superstar
like Tony Danza.

13
00:00:46,172 --> 00:00:49,262
(Howard:)Quick question here, have we actually
changed the conversation...

14
00:00:49,467 --> 00:00:53,217
...from "I'm going to astronaut training"
to "Sheldon can't get a haircut"?

15
00:00:53,429 --> 00:01:00,019
Now who's dying ofjealousy?
"Oh," it's you.

